WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.570
I beg your pardon, my lady.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.030
But El has escaped!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:08.910
Kaisar!

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.380
Thank you, Mugaro!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.590
You may have changed a little bit,

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.970
but you're still Mugaro!

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.840
Get in!

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:25.800
Azazel.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.680
Please help us.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.140
You want to save the demons, don't you?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.100
Help us.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.230
The fugitives from the arena

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.110
are still at large.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.120
We've set a perimeter around the capital
to ensure they do not escape the city.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.910
The man who helped them escape

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.120
was assuredly Favaro Leone.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.580
Yes.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.620
We will handle him with the others.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:58.750
And also regarding the red dragon,
we will be sure to slay it next time.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.260
The red dragon has appeared

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.590
many times wherever that bunch
is involved.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:08.680
We will surely happen upon the dragon
if we pursue them.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:16.480
Kill it on sight.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.150
Is there something I should know
about the red dragon?

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:21.730
No.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:23.740
Go.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.170
Why did you let them escape?

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.130
My apologies.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:42.130
How could you let this happen?

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:46.300
I know that you must understand what it
means for us to lose El at this time.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:48.470
We will send a search party immediately.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.310
Obviously. We must get El back.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.100
I will go.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.270
Stand down!

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:59.400
He will be killed if he's ever captured
by the humans.

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.690
I cannot stand by and watch.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:05.190
You would only get in the way.

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.860
Please forgive my insolence,

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.990
but leaving this matter to those
who are not trusted by El

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.910
is not very reassuring.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.410
I will go alone if I have to.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.330
Wait, Jeanne!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.330
Please leave this to me.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.570
This is awful.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.530
Do you think Rita is okay?

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.150
I don't know.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:52.450
Is that your idea of a disguise?

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:58.920
It's Rita!

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.880
In the flesh.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:11.300
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.930
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:22.190
Cuz there are lots of roads to go
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:27.570
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:33.030
Most broke before they ever came true

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:37.200
But walk this way

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.290
Get out of my way

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:50.300
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:54.970
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:01.270
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.980
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:10.440
But walk this way

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:15.530
Get out of my way

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.580
But walk this way

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.400
Where did Azazel go?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.980
No idea. Haven't seen him since morning.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:50.860
Here.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.570
What's wrong?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.490
This one won't explode, will it?

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.660
Who knows?

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.080
What do you mean, who knows?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.660
Master!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:00.910
We're home.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.330
You're alive, Master!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.540
You're invincible!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.500
Yeah, and I can't believe the luck
you seem to have.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.550
What's that look for?

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:22.600
How are you okay with me,
but you blush with Kaisar?

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:25.270
This is bringing back some memories.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.440
I want some wine.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:30.940
Who is that boy?

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.360
That's Jeanne's son.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.570
Where is Jeanne?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.200
Still in the land of the gods.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.700
I am Kaisar Lidfard.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.540
I used to serve your mother.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:54.130
Someone's gotten angsty
while they were gone.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:06.690
We want to determine
what King Charioce is trying to do.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.060
The weapon the king used
in the last battle,

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.190
its power is far too dangerous.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.030
If the king so wishes,

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:20.780
the world could be put in the same danger
it was in ten years ago.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:30.170
If it wasn't for that weapon, humanity
could be guided back to the right path.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.960
I can do it with my power.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:36.510
What are you talking about, brat?

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:39.680
That's true. If that weapon can be stripped of its power,

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:43.060
we could prevent destruction
no matter what the king's intentions are.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.810
But how?

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.440
The bracelet.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:48.480
Bracelet?

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:53.190
I saw the king control the black thing.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:56.990
It was reacting to his bracelet.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.990
We will steal this bracelet!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:03.330
Mugaro, if you break your promise to me...

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:05.580
I know.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.540
Anyway, we should gather intel for now.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.300
If King Charioce is putting the world
in danger,

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.340
then we must stop him.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.800
We need all of your help.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:35.320
I am sorry I allowed this to happen.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.650
Both for letting them escape,

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:41.360
and also for the part I played
in releasing El's power irresponsibly.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.240
We were rash.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.700
We were blinded by El's powers,

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:53.130
and we neglected the spiritual growth
he needed to use it responsibly.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.590
But please believe me.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.840
I do not want to lose El.
I owe him my life.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:01.430
I wish to bring him back from
the surface world,

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:04.350
so the two of you can be together again.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:08.100
So please leave his search to me.

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.810
Very well.

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.310
You fool!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:58.440
I had faith that you would not let me die.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:04.030
Please come with me to the surface
and help me find El.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.370
I cannot do that.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:13.960
My son and I saved your life.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.840
Now it is your turn to help us.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:24.220
Lady Sofiel, I beseech you.

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.230
You are a fugitive in the surface world.

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:39.020
Can you vow to me that you will not do
anything that would attract danger?

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.230
I vow it.

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:48.070
I suppose this means I am no different
from Bacchus.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.920
I guess that does it.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.380
I look like a real demon!

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.760
All right, I'm off to gather some intel, then!

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.590
Hey! Wait!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.890
I just saw Nina skipping out of here.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.690
She basically went out to play.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.650
I wish I could be so carefree.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:21.820
Why don't you go after her?

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:23.940
What? Why me?

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.570
You're her master, aren't you?

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.400
What's that gotta do with it?

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.320
Just go, Bomber Head.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:33.580
We don't know what she might
get herself into.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.000
We're counting on you, Favaro.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:28.470
Are you serious?

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.520
What are you doing?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.650
I'm a demon!

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.320
What business does a demon have here?

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:56.990
Whose grave is that?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.080
It is my mother's grave.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:01.960
Why are you so surprised?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.790
I'm not surprised!

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:11.680
She was a commoner who became
the king's concubine.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:16.720
A poor woman who was discarded
as soon as she was with child.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.930
Only the royal blood
flowing through my veins

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.730
gave her hope in her life.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:30.110
She dreamed even in poverty that one day
she would be invited to the palace.

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:34.820
But she was killed by Bahamut's fire
before that day could come.

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:41.710
My father was killed
by Bahamut's fireballs as well.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.790
But ironically,

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:48.750
it was because of Bahamut
that I was welcomed to the palace,

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.380
and I was given the new name of
Charioce XVII to replace Chris,

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.760
the one my mother had given me.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:58.970
You are a demon who lives in the slums,
are you not?

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:01.730
Yes.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.480
I always wanted to visit the slums.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:08.230
This is perfect. Could you take me there?

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.990
Take you? Okay.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.700
He definitely knows it's me, right?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:24.500
He said I was a demon just now, but...

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.880
That is an interesting carving.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:33.920
I will take this.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.180
Are you sure?

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:40.390
It is fine.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:42.640
But won't you be recognized?

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:44.600
All right, let's move on.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.850
Okay.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.330
Get back!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.290
Come on, get back on defense!

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:09.210
What are they doing there?

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.340
I don't know. I think they're playing.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.420
I see.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.010
What?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:32.270
-That was awesome!
-Can you show me how to do that?

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.280
All right, here I go!

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.360
Yeah! Go!

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:44.540
Come join us!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:47.500
-Come on, miss!
-Play with us!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:51.040
All right, here I come!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:06.980
What's going on?

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.140
Here.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:14.020
Let's go!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.900
Come on, pass it to me!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.030
All right, go!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:23.410
You sure it's okay to take off
your turban too?

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.040
What does that matter to you?

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.250
There are so many things
I want to ask you.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.380
Look up and to the left.

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:39.800
All right!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.300
One more time!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:43.470
Over there too.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:45.850
Let me see it already!

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.810
Are they watching you?

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:48.980
So close!

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.730
Let's lose them.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.000
Do you think we lost them?

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.880
I think so.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:26.560
It was reacting to his bracelet.

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:38.070
There's something I want to ask you.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.610
What is it?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:42.450
You're the king,

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.410
and you've done a lot of things to make
the demons and the gods hate you.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:50.040
But when you're Chris,
you're so nice to me.

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.670
You dance with me and you smile at me.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:59.050
I don't know which one is the real you.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.930
I want to know what's really inside you.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:15.650
There is something I must achieve
at all costs.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:20.900
But I cannot tell you what that is yet.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:25.910
I can say that everything I've done as king

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.910
was necessary for that purpose.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.540
And this is the result.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.500
I have long since abandoned
any feelings of guilt.

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:41.800
I only answer to my own convictions,

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.180
as I visit the grave of my poor mother.

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:52.430
Not once had my convictions wavered.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:57.350
Not until you came into my life.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.980
If I never met you,

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.240
I could have lived my life as king
without a second thought.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.740
But instead...

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.610
If only I had never met you!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.830
Why you want to become a scary king,

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.420
that I don't know.

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.300
But, how I feel about you...

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:33.520
I want to help you with whatever
you're dealing with.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.300
What is it?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:38.120
I learned how to transform
whenever I want!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:42.000
Maybe it's because we kissed.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.450
When can I see you next?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:57.830
I don't know.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.040
No.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:02.620
-Next time.
-When is next time?

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.290
When? When?

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:05.580
Next time is next time.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.040
Okay.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.380
But the next time we meet,

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.340
I will tell you
what I am trying to accomplish.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.390
-Promise?
-Yes.

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:36.280
Next time, I'll go to see you.

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.330
You should go.

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:13.940
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:21.740
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:30.090
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:37.470
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:45.730
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:22:46.230 --> 00:22:53.280
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:22:53.440 --> 00:23:01.450
I want to run away with you, dancing
just like in a fairy tale

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:09.330
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:13.750
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:18.300
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:18.470 --> 00:23:21.720
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:25.850
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:26.850
Yeah

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:41.820
I knew the red dragon had him
under its spell.

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:48.500
This is Anatae's Kaisar!

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:50.710
Heaven's Jeanne!
How is it over there!

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:52.540
Yes!
Heaven's Jeanne here!

00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:54.540
It's very sparkly!
It's so bright!

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:57.550
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "Invictus."

00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:59.420
Jeanne, could you be more specific?

00:23:59.590 --> 00:24:01.180
I told you, it's bright!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:01.630
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:04.640
Baha Baha Baha Soul

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:06.010
Next time too, okay?
